      "text": "Temporal Workflow Orchestrator\n\nInvestor onboarding state machine\nINVITED → KYC_PENDING → KYC_APPROVED \n→ DOCS_SENT → DOCS_SIGNED \n→ FUNDS_SETTLED → ADMITTED\n\nWorkflow signals are idempotent",
